<title>JAPAN: Kitagawa Iron - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kitagawa Iron - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.04		vs	   18.82</p>
<p> Operating	  428 million	 vs	  670 million</p>
<p> Current	    480 million	 vs	  719 million</p>
<p> Net		  180 million	 vs	  374 million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.14 yen	  vs	    4.42 yen</p>
<p> Shares		85 million	 vs	   85 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kitagawa Iron Works Co Ltd makes meehanite castings, construction machinery and lathe chucks.</p>
